---
// First-visit splash ("Harvest sets sail"). Plays the logo once per browsing
// session, then crossfades away to the page underneath.
//
// Two halves live elsewhere in BaseLayout because they must run earlier than
// <body>: the session check at the very top of <head> (sets
// html[data-boot-gone] before first paint on every later page, so the splash
// never flashes), and the styles (SplashStyles), so this is styled from the
// first byte.
//
// Exit rule: leave the moment BOTH the final beat (the tallest bar's
// `cs-rise-final` animation) has ended AND window "load" has fired — whichever
// lands last triggers it, with no extra timer. A 15s backstop guarantees it
// always goes. The page's own entrance animations and Lenis wait on
// window.onSplashExit(), so visitors still see them as the splash lifts.
//
// The mark is built from the paths in /favicon.svg, regrouped by part. The
// viewBox is a square centred on the icon's own bounding box (x 49–402,
// y 53–401 in favicon space), so centring the <svg> centres the icon itself —
// and SplashHead centres the icon + wordmark group on the screen.
// Animated offsets (SplashHead) are in the inner group's units, so the
// motion scales with the mark: at 77px tall, 1px ≈ 3.7 units.
---
